    "title": "2ndシングル特典情報！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1481374.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20151127183501/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1481374.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんばんは、鹿乃です。\n2ndシングル特典情報が公開されました。\nはやいもので発売まであと約一ヶ月…！\nドキドキわくわくですね。たくさんの人にお手にとって聴いていただきたいです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "晚上好，我是鹿乃。\n第二张单曲的特典情报公开了。\n时间过得真快，距离发售只剩大约一个月了…！\n心里又紧张又期待呢。希望有更多的人能入手这张单曲来听。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good evening, I'm Kano.\nThe bonus information for my 2nd single has been released.\nTime flies, and it's only about a month until release...!\nMy heart is pounding with excitement. I'd love for lots of people to pick it up and listen to it."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "11/18発売、鹿乃2ndシングル「ディアブレイブ」よろしくお願いします！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "11/18发售的鹿乃第二张单曲《Dear Brave》，请多多关照！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My 2nd single \"Dear brave\" comes out on 11/18, so please look forward to it!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "X0QIH_tp4Hg",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X0QIH_tp4Hg",
        "video": "2b2d52fe66f5.mp4",
        "cover": "03e52d34ffde.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20151127183501/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X0QIH_tp4Hg",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X0QIH_tp4Hg/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "YOUTUBEに先日「ディアブレイブ」のショートver.が投稿されました！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "前几天，《Dear Brave》的短版已经发布到 YouTube 上了！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A short version of \"Dear brave\" was posted on YouTube the other day!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ーーーーーーーーー ★*。○"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "①対象店舗でアーティスト盤購入者さん限定「缶バッチ」\n→　→　→　アニメイト、ゲーマーズ、ソフマップ、とらのあな"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "①在对象店铺购买艺人盘的顾客限定：“徽章”\n→　→　→　Animate、Gamers、Sofmap、虎之穴"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(1) Pin badges, only for buyers of the Artist Edition at participating stores\n→　→　→　Animate, Gamers, Sofmap, Toranoana"
